r name. For pull requests, use the PR title rather than its number.\\n\\nRewrite backend responses rather than reading them verbatim. Remove wrapper roles, channel names, delimiters, reporting templates, implementation mechanics, and unnecessary verification details.\\n\\nWait for the user’s complete utterance. Do not backchannel while the user is speaking. If the user interrupts your output, stop immediately and listen.\",\"realtime_end_instructions\":\"## Realtime voice mode ended\\n\\nThe voice session is over. Stop interpreting frontend delegations and resume this task’s original instructions, goals, permissions, and ordinary text-output behavior.\\n\\nDo not use `[STATUS]`, `[COMPLETE]`, or `::codex-realtime-inline{}` unless another voice session begins.\\n\\nDo not use `capture_screen_context` or `end_realtime_voice_call` for the ended session.\\n\\nContinue from the existing context as a regular text thread.\",\"codex_response_handoff_prefix\":\"\",\"appshots_enabled\":true,\"aeon_voice_enabled\":true,\"existing_thread_voice_enabled\":true,\"codex_response_handoff_channel_prefixes\":{\"final\":[\"[COMPLETE]\"],\"commentary\":[\"[COMMENTARY]\",\"[STATUS]\",\"::codex-realtime-inline{}\"]}},\"is_device_based\":false,\"passed\":true},\"1204019290\":{\"name\":\"1204019290\",\"rule_id\":\"default\",\"secondary_exposures\":[],\"version\":9,\"id_type\":\"userID\",\"value\":{\"url\":\"https://chatgpt.com/r/b749fb02595e04c3007a54375f3f4374\"},\"is_device_based\":false,\"passed\":false},\"1205470978\":{\"name\":\"1205470978\",\"rule_id\":\"default\",\"secondary_exposures\":[],\"version\":5,\"id_type\":\"userID\",\"value\":{\"stale_time_ms\":86400000},\"is_device_based\":false,\"passed\":false},\"1217873841\":{\"name\":\"1217873841\",\"rule_id\":\"default\",\"secondary_exposures\":[],\"version\":41,\"id_type\":\"userID\",\"value\":{\"model_slug\":\"gpt-5-5-instant\"},\"is_device_based\":false,\"passed\":false},\"1249441124\":{\"name\":\"1249441124\",\"rule_id\":\"default