major lunar features on a map and explain the difference between a crater and a dark plain in ordinary language.\"},{\"kind\":\"markdown\",\"markdown\":\"## 🧩 Starting point\"},{\"markdown\":\"I can recognize the Moon’s broad light and dark areas. I want to connect those patterns with named places.\",\"kind\":\"markdown\"},{\"markdown\":\"## 🗺️ Learning path\",\"kind\":\"markdown\"},{\"kind\":\"markdown\",\"layout\":\"normal\",\"markdown\":\"| Step | Resource | Practice |\\n| --- | --- | --- |\\n| Get oriented | NASA Moon overview | Label five features on a sketch |\\n| Look closely | A library lunar atlas | Compare two images of one region |\\n| Explain it | My own notes | Write a 100-word visitor caption |\"},{\"kind\":\"markdown\",\"markdown\":\"## 📅 Weekly rhythm\"},{\"kind\":\"markdown\",\"markdown\":\"- [ ] Tuesday: read one short section and draw a sketch.\"},{\"markdown\":\"- [ ] Sunday: revisit the sketch without looking at the labels.\",\"kind\":\"markdown\"},{\"kind\":\"markdown\",\"markdown\":\"- [ ] Explain one feature to a friend.\"},{\"kind\":\"markdown\",\"markdown\":\"## 📝 Notebook\"},{\"kind\":\"markdown\",\"markdown\":\"**Observation:** The same region can look quite different as shadows change.\"},{\"markdown\":\"**Question:** Which lighting makes a crater’s shape easiest to see?\",\"kind\":\"markdown\"},{\"kind\":\"markdown\",\"markdown\":\"## 🔁 Progress check\"},{\"kind\":\"markdown\",\"markdown\":\"I can locate three of the five features without the atlas. Compare those three under different lighting, then add two more and repeat the unlabeled sketch.\"},{\"kind\":\"markdown\",\"markdown\":\"## 🔗 Start here\"},{\"kind\":\"markdown\",\"markdown\":\"[NASA Moon overview](https://science.nasa.gov/moon/)\"}],\"id\":\"learning-plan\",\"prompt\":\"Help me make a plan for something I want to learn. Start with what I already know and what I want to be able to do. Break it into manageable steps with useful resources, practice, and a weekly routine. Include space for notes and progress checks. Use the details I’ve shared and relevant conversations and connected apps you can access to fill in this Page. Ask for missing essentials only after checking that context. Replace the examples with my details and preserve my edits.\",\"prefillPrompt\":\"Make a learning plan with a clear goal, useful resources, practice, and a weekly routine. Use details I’ve shared and relevant conversations and connected apps you can access; ask for what’s missing after checking them. Replace the examples with my details and preserve my edits.\"},{\"previewDocument\":[{\"kind\":\"markdown\",\"markdown\":\"## 🎯 Priorities\"},{\"markdown\":\"- [ ] Finish the lunar exhibit captions.\",\"kind\":\"markdown\"},{\"kind\":\"markdown\",\"markdown\":\"- [ ] Confirm volunteer roles for Friday.\"},{\"kind\":\"markdown\",\"markdown\":\"- [ ] Leave one evening free of commitments.\"},{\"markdown\":\"## 🗓️ Week at a glance\",\"kind\":\"markdown\"},{\"layout\":\"normal\",\"markdown\":\"| Day | Main focus | Commitment |\\n| --- | --- | --- |\\n| Monday | Caption edits | Review with Leo, 14:00 |\\n| Tuesday | Final captions and handout draft | Approve the full print set |\\n| Wednesday | Send approved files to the print shop | Volunteer call, 18:00 |\\n| Thursday | Collect prints and check the room | Free evening |\\n| Friday | Open house | Arrive at 17:15 |\\n| Weekend | Rest and a short walk | Sunday journal time |\",\"kind\":\"markdown\"},{\"kind\":\"markdown\",\"markdown\":\"## 🏡 Everyday life\"},{\"kind\":\"markdown\",\"markdown\":\"- [ ] Pick up groceries on the way home.\"},{\"kind\":\"markdown\",\"markdown\":\"- [ ] Return the library book.\"},{\"markdown\":\"- [ ] Call a friend over the weekend.\",\"kind\":\"markdown\"},{\"markdown\":\"## 📌 Can wait\",\"kind\":\"markdown\"},{\"kind\":\"markdown\",\"markdown\":\"The archive’s video section and the future talk schedule.\"},{\"kind\":\"markdown\",\"markdown\":\"## ✨ Weekend review\"},{\"markdown\":\"**What helped:** Did the shared caption review resolve questions before printing?\",\"kind\":\"markdown\"},{\"markdown\":\"**What to change:** Note any last-minute printing or role changes to allow for in the next event plan.\",\"kind\":\"markdown\"}],\"id\":\"weekly-planner\",\"prefillPrompt\":\"Make a realistic weekly plan around my priorities and commitments, with suggested focus time and room for rest. Use details I’ve shared and relevant conversations and connected apps you can access; ask for what’s missing after checking them. Replace the examples with my details and preserve my edits.\",\"setupQuestion\":\"What do you want to get done this week? Anything already on your calendar?\",\"prompt\":\"Plan my week around the priorities and commitments I’ve shared. Create a short priority list and a realistic day-by-day plan with suggested focus time and room for rest. Ask what matters most this week if you need a starting point. Use the details I’ve shared and relevant conversations and connected apps you can access to fill in this Page. Ask for missing essentials only after checking that context. Replace the examples with my details and preserve my edits.\",\"title\":\"Weekly planner\"},{\"title\":\"Trip planner\",\"setupQuestion\":\"Where would you like to go—or would you like help choosing?\",\"prefillPrompt\":\"Make a flexible trip itinerary and planning checklist, including activities, transport, and accommodation. Help me choose a destination if needed. Use details I’ve shared and relevant conversations and connected apps you can access; ask for what’s missing after checking them. Replace the examples with my details and preserve my edits.\",\"previewDocument\":[{\"kind\":\"markdown\",\"markdown\":\"**Travelers:** Maya and Sam  \\n**Pace:** One main activity a day\"},{\"markdown\":\"## 🧭 The plan\",\"kind\":\"markdown\"},{\"markdown\":\"Plan two nights near a mountain observatory. The visitor tour is the main activity; confirm its availability before choosing transport and accommodation.\",\"kind\":\"markdown\"},{\"kind\":\"markdown\",\"markdown\":\"## 🚆 Travel and stay\"},{\"layout\":\"normal\",\"kind\":\"markdown\",\"markdown\":\"| Item | Plan | Status |\\n| --- | --- | --- |\\n| Outbound | Friday afternoon train, then local shuttle | Compare departure times |\\n| Accommodation | Two nights in the village | Choose a flexible booking |\\n| Return | Sunday afternoon train | Leave time for lunch |\"},{\"kind\":\"markdown\",\"markdown\":\"## 🗓️ Daily outline\"},{\"kind\":\"markdown\",\"layout\":\"normal\",\"markdown\":\"| Day | Main plan | Flexible alternative |\\n| --- | --- | --- |\\n| Friday | Arrive and settle in | Short village walk |\\n| Saturday | Observatory visitor tour | Science museum if tours change |\\n| Sunday | Easy morning walk | Café and photo journal |\"},{\"markdown\":\"## 🎒 Before leaving\",\"kind\":\"markdown\"},{\"kind\":\"markdown\",\"markdown\":\"- [ ] Check the visitor schedule, reserve the tour if required, and review the weather before departure.\"},{\"kind\":\"markdown\",\"markdown\":\"- [ ] Confirm transport and accommodation.\"},{\"kind\":\"markdown\",\"markdown\":\"- [ ] Save tickets and maps offline.\"},{\"markdown\":\"- [ ] Pack warm layers, walking shoes, and a notebook.\",\"kind\":\"markdown\"},{\"kind\":\"markdown\",\"markdown\":\"## 💡 Useful notes\"},{\"markdown\":\"Use a $450 planning allowance for two people: $300 for two nights, $120 for meals, and $30 for local transport. Intercity tickets and any tour fees are additional; confirm actual prices before booking. Keep skywatching optional.\",\"kind\":\"markdown\"}],\"id\":\"trip-planner\",\"prompt\":\"Make a flexible itinerary and planning checklist using the trip details I’ve shared. Include ideas for activities, transport, and accommodation, keeping confirmed bookings easy to identify. Ask where I’d like to go if needed, or help me choose a destination. Use the details I’ve shared and relevant conversations and connected apps you can access to fill in this Page. Ask for missing essentials only after checking that context. Replace the examples with my details and preserve my edits.\"},{\"setupQuestion\":\"What would you like help with—tracking spending, saving toward a goal, or both?\",\"prompt\":\"Use relevant financial information from connected apps you can access to build my budget tracker. Organize income and spending, show how they compare, and help me track progress toward my goals. Use the currency shown in my accounts and start with this month unless I specify otherwise. Keep totals for different currencies separate. Use the details I’ve already shared, and ask for missing essentials only after checking the available information. If no financial information is available, start with an editable budget and ask what I’d like to add. Update this Page and preserve my edits.\",\"title\":\"Budget tracker\",\"id\":\"budget-tracker\",\"prefillPrompt\":\"Use financial information from connected apps you can access and details I’ve shared to make a budget tracker for this month. Organize income and spending and track my savings goals, using my accounts’ currencies and keeping their totals separate. If no figures are available, help me start an editable budget. Update this Page and preserve my edits.\",\"previewMarkdown\":\"## Budget period\\nAdd the time period and currency.\\n\\n## Planned and actual spending\\n| Category | Planned | Actual | Remaining |\\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\\n| Housing | | | |\\n| Food | | | |\\n| Transport | | | |\\n\\n## Transactions\\nAdd income and expenses with dates and sources.\\n\\n## Review\\nNote missing figures and changes for next period.\"},{\"prompt\":\"Organize my apartment search around my location and rent budget. Compare available listings by rent, fees, availability, and my preferences, with links and next steps. If I haven’t added listings yet, start with search criteria and a comparison table. Use the details I’ve shared and relevant conversations and connected apps you can access to fill in this Page. Ask for missing essentials only after checking that context. Update this Page and preserve my edits.\",\"title\":\"Apartment hunter\",\"previewMarkdown\":\"## Search criteria\\nAdd location, budget, move-in timing, and must-haves.\\n\\n## Shortlist\\n| Listing | Rent and fees | Availability | Notes |\\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\\n\\n## Next steps\\n- [ ] Save listings to compare\\n- [ ] Prepare questions for a viewing\\n\\n## Viewing notes\\nRecord observations and questions for each apartment.\",\"prefillPrompt\":\"Help me compare apartments by rent, fees, availability, and my preferences, with listing links and next steps. Use details I’ve shared and relevant conversations and connected apps you can access; ask for what’s missing after checking them. Update this Page and preserve my edits.\",\"id\":\"apartment-hunter\",\"setupQuestion\":\"Where are you looking, and what is your rent budget?\"},{\"prefillPrompt\":\"Help me plan my event, including the schedule, people involved, preparation, and follow-up. Use the details I’ve shared and relevant conversations and connected apps you can access to fill in this Page. Ask for missing essentials only after checking that context. Replace the examples with my details and preserve my edits.\",\"prompt\":\"Make a plan for my event with its purpose, key details, schedule, people involved, and preparation checklist. Include a backup plan and follow-up tasks where useful. Use the details I’ve shared and relevant conversations and connected apps you can access to fill in this Page. Ask for missing essentials only after checking that context. Replace the examples with my details and preserve my edits.\",\"previewDocument\":[{\"kind\":\"markdown\",\"markdown\":\"**Time:** 18:00–20:00 local time  \\n**Place:** Northfield Observatory visitor hall  \\n**Lead:** Sam Rivera\"},{\"kind\":\"markdown\",\"markdown\":\"## 🌙 Purpose\"},{\"markdown\":\"An informal evening of lunar images, short talks, and questions for first-time visitors.\",\"kind\":\"markdown\"},{\"kind\":\"markdown\",\"markdown\":\"## 📋 Essentials\"},{\"kind\":\"markdown\",\"markdown\":\"| Item | Plan |\\n| --- | --- |\\n| Capacity | 40 visitors |\\n| Planning budget | $300 total: $100 printing and $200 refreshments |\\n| Access | Step-free entrance, seating, large-print handouts |\\n| Main contact | Sam at the welcome desk |\",\"layout\":\"normal\"},{\"kind\":\"markdown\",\"markdown\":\"## 🕰️ Run of show\"},{\"kind\":\"markdown\",\"layout\":\"normal\",\"markdown\":\"| Time | Activity | Lead |\\n| --- | --- | --- |\\n| 17:15 | Set up and volunteer briefing | Sam |\\n| 18:00 | Welcome and image gallery | Maya |\\n| 18:30 | A short tour of the lunar landscape | Priya |\\n| 19:00 | Indoor questions; outdoor viewing if conditions allow | Priya |\\n| 20:00 | Close and reset the room | Team |\"},{\"kind\":\"markdown\",\"markdown\":\"## ✅ Preparation\"},{\"markdown\":\"- [ ] Sam: confirm the room layout and step-free visitor route.\",\"kind\":\"markdown\"},{\"kind\":\"markdown\",\"markdown\":\"- [ ] Maya: print 50 handouts and the caption cards before the room check.\"},{\"kind\":\"markdown\",\"markdown\":\"- [ ] Priya: confirm the observing setup and brief volunteers on the indoor alternative.\"},{\"markdown\":\"## ☁️ If plans change\",\"kind\":\"markdown\"},{\"markdown\":\"At 16:00, Sam confirms whether outdoor viewing will run. The indoor event goes ahead either way. Sam updates the welcome desk and guest message; if viewing is cancelled, Priya extends the indoor questions and image discussion.\",\"kind\":\"markdown\"},{\"markdown\":\"## 📝 Afterwards\",\"kind\":\"markdown\"},{\"kind\":\"markdown\",\"markdown\":\"- [ ] Gather short visitor comments.\"},{\"kind\":\"markdown\",\"markdown\":\"- [ ] Record useful changes for the next event.\"}],\"id\":\"event-plan\",\"title\":\"Event Plan\",\"setupQuestion\":\"What event are you planning?\"},{\"prefillPrompt\":\"Help me make a plan for my pe